Third-party and reference material
================================================================================

OpenLaunch is a clean-room reimplementation. The following material is either
referenced, vendored, or used as a build/test dependency. It is NOT relicensed
by this project; the original terms and copyrights apply.

1. Unlaunch and DSi firmware reference material (`asm/`)

   The `asm/` directory contains reverse-engineering notes, disassembly, and
   extracted binaries derived from Martin Korth's Unlaunch and from Nintendo DSi
   firmware/NAND dumps. All rights remain with their respective owners. This
   material is included for interoperability and research reference and is not
   covered by the GPL-3.0-or-later grant for OpenLaunch's own source code.

   No Nintendo ROMs, NAND images, console-unique keys, or other copyrighted
   data are distributed as part of OpenLaunch.

2. Astronaut

